  "chatEncNoticeDirect": "Your messages are encrypted in transit and on the server.",
  "chatEncNoticeGroup": "Messages in this chat are encrypted in transit and on the server. All members of the chat can see them.",
  "chatEncNoticeRoom": "Messages in this room are encrypted in transit and on the server. All members of the room can see them.",
  "chatEncMore": "Learn more",
  "chatEncPageTitle": "Chat security",
  "chatEncHeroTitle": "Your messages are encrypted",
  "chatEncHeroBody": "Your messages are encrypted in transit and on the server. Below we explain plainly what is protected, how, and what you should keep in mind.",
  "chatEncSecHow": "How it is protected",
  "chatEncTlsTitle": "Encrypted in transit",
  "chatEncTlsBody": "Your messages and chat photos travel between the app and the server over an encrypted connection (TLS/WSS).",
  "chatEncRestTitle": "Encrypted storage on the server",
  "chatEncRestBody": "Messages are stored encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a separate key for each chat; chat photos and videos are stored encrypted too. The keys are kept apart from the database, in the server environment. This makes messages harder to read even if a database backup is obtained.",
  "chatEncAuditTitle": "Admin access is logged",
  "chatEncAuditBody": "Only authorized administrators can look at conversations, and only for reasons such as reviewing a report, security or legal requests. Every view is written to a tamper-proof access log before the content is shown.",
  "chatEncBlockTitle": "Block and report",
  "chatEncBlockBody": "You can block people you do not want to hear from and report inappropriate messages and users. Messages from someone you blocked are not delivered to you.",
  "chatEncOnceTitle": "View-once photos",
  "chatEncOnceBody": "The recipient can open a view-once photo only one time; after opening it they cannot see it again.",
  "chatEncDeleteTitle": "Delete for everyone",
  "chatEncDeleteBody": "You can delete your own message for everyone; others see a note that it was deleted instead of the message.",
  "chatEncExifTitle": "Location is removed from photos",
  "chatEncExifBody": "Photos you send are re-encoded on the server and EXIF data such as location is removed.",
  "chatEncDataTitle": "Your data is yours",
  "chatEncDataBody": "From the Profile section you can download your data or delete your account.",
  "chatEncNoSellTitle": "Not sold, not shared for ads",
  "chatEncNoSellBody": "We do not sell your data and we do not share it with third parties for advertising.",
  "chatEncSecKnow": "What you should know",
  "chatEncNotE2eeTitle": "Not end-to-end encrypted",
  "chatEncNotE2eeBody": "Messages in this app are not end-to-end encrypted. The encryption keys are held on the server, so the system can decrypt messages when necessary. Please use the app with this in mind.",
  "chatEncRetainTitle": "Deleted content may be kept",
  "chatEncRetainBody": "The encrypted copy of messages deleted for everyone, their edit history and the encrypted copy of view-once photos may be kept on the server for security review. Retention periods are stated in the Privacy Policy.",
  "chatEncMembersTitle": "Everyone in a group can see",
  "chatEncMembersBody": "Messages in groups, club rooms and event rooms can be seen by all members of the room.",
  "chatEncScreenshotTitle": "Screenshots cannot be prevented",
  "chatEncScreenshotBody": "The other person can capture a message with a screenshot or another device and share it. We cannot fully prevent this, even for view-once photos.",
  "chatEncAccountTitle": "Messages remain after account deletion",
  "chatEncAccountBody": "If you delete your account, your personal details are anonymized; the messages you sent remain as part of the chat under an anonymous author.",
  "chatEncSecHelp": "Report and block",
  "chatEncHelpMessage": "To report a message, press and hold it and tap {report}.",
  "chatEncHelpPerson": "To block or report someone in a one-to-one chat, tap the name at the top; in chat info use {block} or {report}.",
